"""Build original sign meshes, pixel textures and an entirely offline review page.

Python 3 + Pillow + numpy. Run from any directory. --check compares all
generated bytes without writing. Only this tool's directory is ever written.
The saved preview font is a separate, credited input; no glyph enters an asset.
"""

